  <name>md-editor</name>
  <summary>WYSIWYG Markdown editor</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      md-editor is a WYSIWYG Markdown editor: you write and format on the
      rendered text, without seeing the syntax, and it saves back to plain
      Markdown.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>WYSIWYG editing with a clean round-trip to plain Markdown</li>
      <li>TeX formulas, tables with alignment, footnotes and interactive task lists</li>
      <li>Outline panel with drag-to-reorder sections</li>
      <li>Eight themes, a distraction-free mode and a split source view</li>
      <li>Export to PDF, HTML, ODT, DOCX, LaTeX and EPUB</li>
      <li>Interface available in 10 languages</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

